ManaBox_Collection.csv

# Everything under data/ is a regenerable cached artifact per the project's
# own design ("cache everything, reruns should be cheap"): Scryfall bulk
# downloads, the Spellbook combo dump, per-deck Archidekt JSON, the SQLite
# database, the fitted model, and generated reports. Multiple GB combined --
# none of it belongs in git. Run the pipeline (see README) to regenerate it.
data/cache/
data/db/
data/reports/
data/cache/ingest_raw/

